                        "entry_id": "6a379419-54e0-352c-86bb-a9f64bfb4b6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A great landed estate with absentee ownership and labor often in a state of partial servitude."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-plural"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85b435c3-bda8-4b33-a9df-7b3fa7081356",
                                "sense_id": "c0db5b9b-2ef0-3b71-b01a-e3a825041da0",
                                "text": "The conclusive military victory of Philip V left the grandees stranded, still rich and still powerful on their latifundia, but stripped of the ‘aristocratic republicanism’ they had previously enjoyed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe43fa21-7fb2-4461-a18b-c2b77cf8ce29",
                                "sense_id": "c0db5b9b-2ef0-3b71-b01a-e3a825041da0",
                                "text": "His vision for the future of the African continent in the Age of the Aerotropolis seems to be as a vast latifundium sown with GM wheat."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
